  "descriptionModule": {
   "briefSummary": "The aim of the study is to evaluate the effect of erdosteine, compared to placebo, on exacerbation rate over a 12-month treatment period in patients with moderate-to-severe COPD. Moreover, the effects of erdosteine on pulmonary function parameters, clinical symptoms and quality of life, and the long-term safety of the drug will be assessed."
  },
